# Normalise line endings: LF in the repository, native on checkout.
#
# `context/` is committed so the plans travel between machines. Without this,
# a machine whose `core.autocrlf` differs from this one's would show every
# context file as wholly rewritten, and the plans would conflict on every pull.
# Pinning it here makes the stored form LF regardless of anyone's local config.
* text=auto
